 "name_en": "Material Replenishment with Kanban – Stock Transfer within EWM (7VD)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Material Replenishment with Kanban – Stock Transfer within EWM (7VD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The Kanban method for controlling production and material flow is based on the actual stock quantity in production. With Kanban, instead of being pushed through production by higher-level planning, materials are called from the supply source by production at the manufacturing level where they’re needed (pull principle). Replenishment or production of a material is only triggered when a higher production level requires the material. This replenishment is triggered directly in production using previously maintained master data.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Set Available Kanban to EMPTY</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Confirm Move of Products from the High Rack Pallet Buffer to the Handover Point</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Change the Kanban to FULL</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process runs within a storage location but can as well perform the stock transfer to another storage location.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Improved Space utilization in the Production Area</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Production Supply synchronized with physical consumption</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Inventory Reduction</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\"></span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\"></span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通过看板的物料补货 – EWM 内的库存转储 (7VD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">用于控制生产和物料流的看板方法，基于生产中的实际库存数量。使用看板，不是通过更高级别的计划来推动生产，而是在需要的制造级别从生产供货源调用物料（拉式原则）。仅当更高的生产级别需要物料时才会触发物料的补货或生产。使用先前维护的主数据直接在生产中触发此补货。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将可用看板设置为 EMPTY</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确认产品从高架托盘缓冲区移动到移交点。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将看板更改为 FULL</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">该流程在存储地点内运行，但也可以执行到其他存储地点的库存转储。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">改进生产区域中的空间利用率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">生产供应已与实际消耗同步</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">库存减少</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\"></span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5f846dfed79f4168bd529a1f4e9bff7a__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\"></span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
